{"id":5310,"date":"2025-08-29T15:50:24","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T08:50:24","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=5310"},"modified":"2025-09-25T20:14:37","modified_gmt":"2025-09-25T13:14:37","slug":"lich-rut-tien-shopee","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-shopee\/lich-rut-tien-shopee\/","title":{"rendered":"L\u1ecbch r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n Shopee theo c\u00e1ch th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"I1JVddiaUolq3JxKwXxlX2YYghf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LUePdwCn8oZ6u7xr2Pnld36yg4u\">&#8220;L\u00e0m th\u1ebf n\u00e0o v\u00e0 khi n\u00e0o t\u00f4i s\u1ebd nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ti\u1ec1n tr\u00ean Shopee?&#8221;. \u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi m\u00e0 <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital <\/a><\/strong>nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhi\u1ec1u nh\u1ea5t t\u1eeb anh ch\u1ecb b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean s\u00e0n TM\u0110T Shopee. Vi\u1ec7c n\u1eafm r\u00f5 quy tr\u00ecnh v\u00e0 l\u1ecbch r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n Shopee kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n an t\u00e2m m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd d\u00f2ng ti\u1ec1n kinh doanh. Shopee cung c\u1ea5p hai h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 <strong>T\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng<\/strong> v\u00e0 <strong>Th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng. <\/strong>B\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y s\u1ebd cung c\u1ea5p th\u00f4ng tin chi ti\u1ebft v\u00e0 c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt nh\u1ea5t v\u1ec1 c\u1ea3 hai c\u01a1 ch\u1ebf, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p nh\u1ea5t v\u1edbi nhu c\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-JWnRdpLqfoaWz1xSEimleaTpg6b\">L\u1ecbch r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n Shopee t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng\u00a0<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sm4ddNcsEoB5cCx00V9lNhuMg2f\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n m\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ecbnh, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp s\u1eb5n \u0111\u1ec3 mang l\u1ea1i s\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7n l\u1ee3i cho Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q67YdVpJVooRu2xTlaglKAeegwg\">Shopee cho ph\u00e9p Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn m\u1ed9t trong hai l\u1ecbch r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FzsYdj4ybo9WqkxwKOIlrleWgue\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>H\u00e0ng tu\u1ea7n:<\/strong> Ti\u1ec1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng chuy\u1ec3n t\u1eeb S\u1ed1 d\u01b0 TK Shopee v\u1ec1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n v\u00e0o <strong>th\u1ee9 Ba m\u1ed7i tu\u1ea7n<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DRA3dfVwtoIuDix75Tcl9QoagWc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>H\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng:<\/strong> Ti\u1ec1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng chuy\u1ec3n v\u1ec1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n v\u00e0o <strong>ng\u00e0y 15 m\u1ed7i th\u00e1ng<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MjuWdI2n5ojLXRxXR41lrMitgUb\">B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u00f9y ch\u1ec9nh l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn n\u00e0y trong ph\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp V\u00ed Shopee c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D9wndAdGHooeocxwXfMlwM2Kglh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u01afu \u0111i\u1ec3m:<\/strong> C\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 ti\u1ec7n l\u1ee3i, b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n ph\u1ea3i th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 thao t\u00e1c n\u00e0o. Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n b\u1eadn r\u1ed9n, kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 th\u1eddi gian theo d\u00f5i v\u00e0 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n l\u1ec7nh r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QYnPdEsoroPVdbxrSVLl6rDBgjc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m:<\/strong> B\u1ea1n ph\u1ea3i ch\u1edd \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111\u00fang ng\u00e0y theo l\u1ecbch c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh m\u1edbi nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ti\u1ec1n, thi\u1ebfu linh ho\u1ea1t khi c\u1ea7n xoay v\u00f2ng v\u1ed1n ho\u1eb7c r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n g\u1ea5p.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-NhowdSq9moWlOWxas9QlAMeRgte\">L\u1ecbch r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n Shopee theo c\u00e1ch th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A81SdnDb8oAGuSxJXZQlI7JFgHe\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhi\u1ec1u nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng \u01b0a chu\u1ed9ng nh\u1edd s\u1ef1 linh ho\u1ea1t v\u00e0 ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-QkkBdwMDhoIKZ7x7wT2lDlI7ghK\">Kh\u00e1i ni\u1ec7m v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PSHqdzMv9or0oKx2M0nl4mCXgPb\">R\u00fat ti\u1ec1n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng cho ph\u00e9p b\u1ea1n t\u1ea1o y\u00eau c\u1ea7u r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n t\u1eeb S\u1ed1 d\u01b0 TK Shopee v\u1ec1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00e3 li\u00ean k\u1ebft b\u1ea5t c\u1ee9 khi n\u00e0o b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 nhu c\u1ea7u. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 to\u00e0n quy\u1ec1n quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m v\u00e0 s\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n mu\u1ed1n r\u00fat (mi\u1ec5n l\u00e0 s\u1ed1 d\u01b0 kh\u1ea3 d\u1ee5ng).<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-GXq3dLcXNoGyZlxQjTrlbXkIg2b\">L\u1ecbch x\u1eed l\u00fd v\u00e0 th\u1eddi gian nh\u1eadn ti\u1ec1n<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TFSYdjLAto32JDxhAdjlYn1dgse\">Th\u1eddi gian ti\u1ec1n v\u1ec1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m b\u1ea1n t\u1ea1o l\u1ec7nh r\u00fat:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T2Yddym5yoalwExc1EUlacBugGg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n t\u1ea1o l\u1ec7nh tr\u01b0\u1edbc 8:00 s\u00e1ng v\u00e0o c\u00e1c ng\u00e0y trong tu\u1ea7n (Th\u1ee9 2 &#8211; Th\u1ee9 6): L\u1ec7nh r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c Shopee x\u1eed l\u00fd v\u00e0 chuy\u1ec3n cho ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng trong c\u00f9ng ng\u00e0y l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XoQidRqUloWwZkxNcD9lR216gJh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n t\u1ea1o l\u1ec7nh sau 8:00 s\u00e1ng ho\u1eb7c v\u00e0o c\u00e1c ng\u00e0y cu\u1ed1i tu\u1ea7n (Th\u1ee9 7, Ch\u1ee7 Nh\u1eadt) v\u00e0 ng\u00e0y l\u1ec5: L\u1ec7nh r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1eddi sang v\u00e0 x\u1eed l\u00fd v\u00e0o ng\u00e0y l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c ti\u1ebfp theo.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H2dida76toBwG4xmbOnlMSkogff\">Sau khi Shopee x\u1eed l\u00fd, ti\u1ec1n s\u1ebd m\u1ea5t th\u00eam m\u1ed9t kho\u1ea3ng th\u1eddi gian \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chuy\u1ec3n qua h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng. Th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ti\u1ec1n trong v\u00f2ng 24 gi\u1edd k\u1ec3 t\u1eeb l\u00fac l\u1ec7nh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u1eed l\u00fd.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-BNIwdn3JmoRspmxGR0FlzF0Ugzg\">Quy tr\u00ecnh r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n c\u1ee7a Shopee cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VjDZdaMbLotNARxOpooljg78g1b\">\u0110\u1ec3 r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n t\u1eeb Shopee, b\u1ea1n truy c\u1eadp &#8220;K\u00eanh ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n&#8221; ho\u1eb7c m\u1ee5c &#8220;T\u00f4i&#8221; trong \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng, ch\u1ecdn &#8220;S\u1ed1 d\u01b0 TK Shopee&#8221; \u2192 &#8220;R\u00fat ti\u1ec1n&#8221; \u2192 \u0110i\u1ec1n s\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n mu\u1ed1n r\u00fat \u2192 Ch\u1ecdn t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng \u2192 X\u00e1c nh\u1eadn b\u1eb1ng m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u ho\u1eb7c m\u00e3 PIN \u0111\u1ec3 ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t. Sau khi y\u00eau c\u1ea7u, ti\u1ec1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chuy\u1ec3n v\u1ec1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n trong v\u00f2ng 48 gi\u1edd l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;e26a7e86-34a8-455b-9aea-c60c6a7f4db8&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FZygwbHht5oNr1CxJXZBlwpB4g9c%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;ZygwbHht5oNr1CxJXZBlwpB4g9c&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:271936,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5311\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5311\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5311\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/613cb758-3583-4a75-8404-92e4568d9c7a.png\" alt=\"Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 setup r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng ho\u1eb7c r\u00fat th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean V\u00ed Shopee c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/613cb758-3583-4a75-8404-92e4568d9c7a.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/613cb758-3583-4a75-8404-92e4568d9c7a-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/613cb758-3583-4a75-8404-92e4568d9c7a-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/613cb758-3583-4a75-8404-92e4568d9c7a-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/613cb758-3583-4a75-8404-92e4568d9c7a-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5311\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 setup r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng ho\u1eb7c r\u00fat th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean V\u00ed Shopee c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"I1JVddiaUolq3JxKwXxlX2YYghf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-TOMxdWFfNomF4WxhhbGlaiZBg2g\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng t\u1eeb Shopee<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XqBcdmb8eoLPHixpD1nlDU1UgNh\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c cho ph\u00e9p b\u1ea1n ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n b\u1ea5t c\u1ee9 khi n\u00e0o b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-JoELdy1LboRZF6xhDe4lVmVIgNf\">C\u00e1ch th\u1ee9c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n<\/h3>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Op7dd47NNoueYwxzHEKlhXYZgHc\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1:<\/strong> Ch\u1ecdn m\u1ee5c <strong>S\u1ed1 d\u01b0 TK Shopee <\/strong>sau \u0111\u00f3 nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o n\u00fat <strong>R\u00fat ti\u1ec1n<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-PIrzdYltgoBNetxbzQllxjKqgBd\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;3a25f207-7524-4edb-ae2f-b92ec9a853d7&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;plug