\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/6ea5b0b4-560f-49f7-8339-979556f993f3.png\" alt=\"X\u00e1c nh\u1eadn th\u00f4ng tin v\u00e0 nh\u1eadp m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u V\u00ed ShopeePay \u0111\u1ec3 ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t y\u00eau c\u1ea7u\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/6ea5b0b4-560f-49f7-8339-979556f993f3.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/6ea5b0b4-560f-49f7-8339-979556f993f3-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/6ea5b0b4-560f-49f7-8339-979556f993f3-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/6ea5b0b4-560f-49f7-8339-979556f993f3-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/6ea5b0b4-560f-49f7-8339-979556f993f3-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5314\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>X\u00e1c nh\u1eadn th\u00f4ng tin v\u00e0 nh\u1eadp m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u V\u00ed ShopeePay \u0111\u1ec3 ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t y\u00eau c\u1ea7u<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"I1JVddiaUolq3JxKwXxlX2YYghf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-F8hmd2Ptwo2F9xxYbolldLHEgRg\">Th\u1eddi gian x\u1eed l\u00fd<\/h3>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnmLde7djoWcxkx608tlbVyQgdc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Th\u1eddi gian x\u1eed l\u00fd y\u00eau c\u1ea7u:<\/strong> Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c Shopee x\u1eed l\u00fd g\u1ea7n nh\u01b0 ngay l\u1eadp t\u1ee9c sau khi b\u1ea1n x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EUfOdJFsWoMJokxvHIMlV1XzgTh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Th\u1eddi gian ti\u1ec1n v\u1ec1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng:<\/strong> Th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng, ti\u1ec1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chuy\u1ec3n v\u00e0o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n trong v\u00f2ng <strong>24 gi\u1edd l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c<\/strong> (kh\u00f4ng t\u00ednh th\u1ee9 B\u1ea3y, Ch\u1ee7 Nh\u1eadt v\u00e0 c\u00e1c ng\u00e0y L\u1ec5, T\u1ebft).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y3G8d8qnloIciHxBgRRllhpTgu6\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u01afu \u0111i\u1ec3m:<\/strong> Ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n b\u1ea5t c\u1ee9 khi n\u00e0o c\u1ea7n (t\u1ed1i \u0111a 1 l\u1ea7n\/ng\u00e0y), gi\u00fap qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd d\u00f2ng ti\u1ec1n linh ho\u1ea1t.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CCk5dHkFIorjzcx9WEwlb0s0gPc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m:<\/strong> Ph\u1ea3i t\u1ef1 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n thao t\u00e1c th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng m\u1ed7i l\u1ea7n mu\u1ed1n r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-DIbcdga5loSXFPx8xG7lgbSWgCQ\">So s\u00e1nh r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I98Mdv7dSochFgxAJYtlABxCglL\">\u0110\u1ec3 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tham kh\u1ea3o b\u1ea3ng so s\u00e1nh tr\u1ef1c quan d\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-VueQdEkzzo0C49xIAwAlkTbKg7c\" data-type=\"sheet\">\n<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"105\" \/>\n<col width=\"253\" \/>\n<col width=\"422\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Ti\u00eau ch\u00ed<\/td>\n<td>R\u00fat ti\u1ec1n T\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng<\/td>\n<td>R\u00fat ti\u1ec1n Th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Th\u1eddi gian<\/td>\n<td>C\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh (Th\u1ee9 Ba h\u00e0ng tu\u1ea7n ho\u1eb7c ng\u00e0y 15 h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng)<\/td>\n<td>B\u1ea5t c\u1ee9 l\u00fac n\u00e0o (trong gi\u1edd h\u00e0nh ch\u00ednh)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C\u00e1ch th\u1ee9c<\/td>\n<td>T\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n<\/td>\n<td>Ph\u1ea3i thao t\u00e1c th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>M\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng<\/td>\n<td>Th\u1ee5 \u0111\u1ed9ng<\/td>\n<td>Ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\u0110\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p<\/td>\n<td>Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n b\u1eadn r\u1ed9n, kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 nhu c\u1ea7u r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n l\u1ebb m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y.<\/td>\n<td>Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n c\u1ea7n s\u1ef1 linh ho\u1ea1t, mu\u1ed1n xoay v\u00f2ng v\u1ed1n nhanh.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-WxjpdOK88o1t31xoGw6lq9JzgDh\">Ph\u00ed r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n v\u00e0 c\u00e1c l\u01b0u \u00fd quan tr\u1ecdng<\/h3>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-GM6udeGa5oglctxO6hWlRpr8gqc\">Ph\u00ed r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MkLrdxaujo9OtVxArmylaATMgIr\">Theo ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7n h\u00e0nh c\u1ee7a Shopee, vi\u1ec7c r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n t\u1eeb S\u1ed1 d\u01b0 TK Shopee l\u00e0 <strong>ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed<\/strong>. B\u1ea1n s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i tr\u1ea3 b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed n\u00e0o cho c\u1ea3 h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-YlqndJPofoZnyvxRDTGlCr3vgVb\">C\u00e1c l\u01b0u \u00fd kh\u00e1c<\/h3>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O4DJdxUiQo9FnexavgWlzZxcgqf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ki\u1ec3m tra th\u00f4ng tin t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng:<\/strong> Lu\u00f4n \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o s\u1ed1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n v\u00e0 t\u00ean ch\u1ee7 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 li\u00ean k\u1ebft l\u00e0 ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c tuy\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh giao d\u1ecbch th\u1ea5t b\u1ea1i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RFRUdOnLDolKkxxhH2KlJ7F9gFf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ch\u00ednh ch\u1ee7:<\/strong> T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng li\u00ean k\u1ebft ph\u1ea3i c\u00f3 t\u00ean ch\u1ee7 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n tr\u00f9ng kh\u1edbp v\u1edbi th\u00f4ng tin tr\u00ean CMND\/CCCD m\u00e0 b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 x\u00e1c th\u1ef1c v\u1edbi Shopee.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZSNdhaHvot4MVxzB72lE8LngUd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>L\u00fd do r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n ch\u1eadm\/th\u1ea5t b\u1ea1i:<\/strong> Giao d\u1ecbch c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ecb ch\u1eadm tr\u1ec5 ho\u1eb7c th\u1ea5t b\u1ea1i n\u1ebfu th\u00f4ng tin t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng kh\u00f4ng ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c, ho\u1eb7c h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng \u0111ang trong th\u1eddi gian b\u1ea3o tr\u00ec.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-AmIXdvuF3oAOAdxsn1oldFLngKe\">C\u00e1c c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p (FAQs)<\/h2>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IRUUdwttYoKWvRx2YFrlT6aKgtc\" start=\"1\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\"><strong>T\u1ea1i sao t\u00f4i kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n t\u1eeb Shopee?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUUOdwrMRo3WvSxbBjSlhFJzgGb\">C\u00e1c l\u00fd do ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn bao g\u1ed3m: b\u1ea1n ch\u01b0a li\u00ean k\u1ebft t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng, th\u00f4ng tin t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng kh\u00f4ng ch\u00ednh ch\u1ee7, ho\u1eb7c t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Shopee c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111ang c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n do ch\u01b0a x\u00e1c th\u1ef1c \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 th\u00f4ng tin.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WC92dHO8io16EvxhoOflsjWQg7d\" start=\"2\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\"><strong>C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n v\u00e0o cu\u1ed1i tu\u1ea7n ho\u1eb7c ng\u00e0y l\u1ec5 kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WuRHdKs6boxcsKx7OUMlSmFvg7e\">\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, b\u1ea1n v\u1eabn c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1eb7t l\u1ec7nh r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n v\u00e0o cu\u1ed1i tu\u1ea7n ho\u1eb7c ng\u00e0y l\u1ec5. Tuy nhi\u00ean, y\u00eau c\u1ea7u n\u00e0y s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u1eed l\u00fd v\u00e0 ti\u1ec1n s\u1ebd v\u1ec1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n v\u00e0o ng\u00e0y l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c ti\u1ebfp theo c\u1ee7a ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OHPkdCTn0oyLS0xgRDxl8Oyagbf\" start=\"3\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\"><strong>L\u00e0m sao \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ee7y l\u1ec7nh r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JASwdb3HnoqcFZxuRd7lfW4igjg\">M\u1ed9t khi b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn l\u1ec7nh r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd <strong>kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 h\u1ee7y<\/strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c. Do \u0111\u00f3, h\u00e3y ki\u1ec3m tra th\u1eadt k\u1ef9 s\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n v\u00e0 th\u00f4ng tin t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NRuKd1VCcoiVoixfhUPlrWT5g5e\" start=\"4\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\"><strong>C\u00f3 gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n s\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n r\u00fat m\u1ed7i l\u1ea7n kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V8DfdJscvoiUSUxfGghltWVbgTd\">C\u00f3. Shopee c\u00f3 quy \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u1ec1 h\u1ea1n m\u1ee9c r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n t\u1ed1i \u0111a trong m\u1ed9t ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o an to\u00e0n cho t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n. H\u1ea1n m\u1ee9c n\u00e0y c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00f9y theo ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a Shopee t\u1ea1i t\u1eebng th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YACVdRVJyo4y3ZxptZrlMjFcgmd\">C\u1ea3 hai h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n T\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 Th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean Shopee \u0111\u1ec1u c\u00f3 nh\u1eefng \u01b0u v\u00e0 nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m ri\u00eang, ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 cho c\u00e1c nhu c\u1ea7u kh\u00e1c nhau c\u1ee7a Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u01b0u ti\u00ean s\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7n l\u1ee3i, h\u00e3y \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n s\u1ef1 linh ho\u1ea1t t\u1ed1i \u0111a cho d\u00f2ng ti\u1ec1n, h\u00e3y t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng t\u00ednh n\u0103ng r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OIehdUSZjoAzq6xiViTlbXQsgWg\">Ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng trong vi\u1ec7c r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd d\u00f2ng ti\u1ec1n t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n, \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n quan tr\u1ecdng trong vi\u1ec7c v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh kinh doanh hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 tr\u00ean Shopee. \u0110\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c kinh doanh to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n v\u00e0 b\u1ee9t ph\u00e1 doanh s\u1ed1, c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u00ecm \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ef1 t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p t\u1eeb <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong>.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ln8Jdi2Aqoy8qvxtdfQlsLL9gJe\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BD6adBkv5ogu20xa8kvlHuSFgqe\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y31tdgBu5ozz0yxroSllNSFggig\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba c